# TrustOS Architecture

## The Five Gaps

| Gap | Solution |
|-----|----------|
| Provenance Loss | AIRI-DNA |
| Authority Drift | SHAPE Protocol |
| Memory Erosion | Living Ledger |
| Evidence Vacuum | TABS |
| Accountability Collapse | Verifiable Receipts |

## Core Thesis

Trustworthy agentic execution is achievable when identity, provenance, evidence, authority, execution, verification, and accountability are represented as interoperable machine-verifiable state.

